{"title":"2020 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/a/b9ad232d51ae83abd9f18e8e6c475c8330f8d3c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3y - 2x = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"17\" />, determine the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/a/faac0deca3fdd44ea7206de9945b70eae0c80324.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{16^{x + 1}}{8^{2y - 1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"49\" height=\"41\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/2/9b2ab0ce560a0f76b30b3842c0fe3806043e4d5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{4} = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"58\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/f/6ffbc99e2825b6f4458b370bae99157e55a79e65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{3} = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/2/5824816b04404f3a9e921df5c7a6040cf36ac3b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a^{b})^{c} = a^{bc}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"85\" height=\"22\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/9/c79c0aff7b106389d12004e5e07af88327d25f93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a^{b}}{a^{c}} = a^{b - c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"79\" height=\"41\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/3/e33f2e9e3f5634f0ca10c11f9b69d51b6cc56084.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{-b} = \\frac{1}{a^{b}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"73\" height=\"38\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/2/1e2c88ba89a113254fee54eb484e860fed489b43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(2^4)^{x + 1}}{(2^3)^{2y - 1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"68\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/3/fe3525a22677266d542c35ce8f2ccfc49c950fc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{2^{4(x + 1)}}{2^{3(2y - 1)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"83\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/d/66d2dbf4ac1285a72b43b1d8ebbec72a1fb994b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{2^{4 \\times x + 4 \\times 1}}{2^{3 \\times 2y + 3 \\times -1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"110\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/5/da5b7d89f0a1e0f00c133afd93c1a2d1d6be7ea4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{2^{4x + 4}}{2^{6y - 3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"66\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/7/247b3131adfa9eba745844026d3b2ce8fcb19ed8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=2^{4x + 4 - 6y + 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"103\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/7/017e08644107e35db54ff17577f6ffdb9a8117b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{4x - 6y + 7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"67\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/d/a3d12e1680c0a5ec21d5d7ba5603d068ee09a32b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=2^{-2(\\frac{4}{-2}x + \\frac{-6}{-2}y) + 7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"137\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/0/000731ed2aa5ede1f6faaaafb3563a7bd0e59015.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=2^{-2(3y - 2x) + 7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"113\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/a/b9ad232d51ae83abd9f18e8e6c475c8330f8d3c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3y - 2x = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"17\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/a/3ba1d797d9ee66d9cd885b08cbbeae6318466d2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{-2(3y - 2x) + 7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"94\" height=\"18\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/5/8c56e9a6eaa84ac7582b4ebe64a9c69a3f94f3eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{-2(4) + 7} = 2^{-8 + 7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"131\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/3/9731c6ca2d55914702f90c566ed086c16bf1c077.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=2^{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"48\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/4/b944939f8b295bb3264e2edc01aa01c5b2ffda7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\frac{1}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"45\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC\" title=\"2020 CEMC CTMC\">2020 CEMC CTMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CEMC CTMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CEMC CTMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 9 (page does not exist)\">Team Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 11 (page does not exist)\">Team Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_1\" title=\"2020 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 1\">Individual 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_2\" title=\"2020 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 2\">Individual 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Individual 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_4\" title=\"2020 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 4\">Individual 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Individual 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_6\" title=\"2020 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 6\">Individual 6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_7\" title=\"2020 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 7\">Individual 7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Pro